Package: DeclareDesign
Type: Package
Title: A Tidyverse-First Research Design Declaration and Diagnosis Tool
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(person("Alex", "Coppock", email = "acoppock@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Declares, simulates, diagnoses and redesigns research designs.
    A design is declared as a model, an inquiry, a data strategy and an answer
    strategy, then simulated with purrr and diagnosed with dplyr. Version 2.0
    is a ground-up rewrite of the package on tidyverse conventions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    randomizr (>= 1.0.1),
    fabricatr (>= 2.0.0),
    estimatr (>= 2.0.0)
Imports:
    broom,
    dplyr,
    generics,
    parallel,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyr
Remotes:
    DeclareDesign/fabricatr@rewrite,
    DeclareDesign/estimatr@rewrite
Suggests:
    furrr,
    future,
    knitr,
    MASS,
    progressr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
